{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119703","id":4511336253,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDOWHPQ","number":119703,"title":"EditorProperty does not expose has_borders","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-24T11:07:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:57:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.7-beta3\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 44\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen working with the `EditorProperty`, there is no way to mimic the same behavior that is observed in other editor properties, e.g. Arrays or Dictionaries, where the expanded panel and label are rendered with special borders & themeing.\n\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"155\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35750843-cd85-4097-b2a7-2bd3b1bb46fd\" />\n\nBy exposing the `has_borders` property, this ideally should suffice for adding the border around the child elements when expanded, and it should also satisfy coloring the label with a brighter text color, and background color to match the border.\n\nBy handling the border drawing in a sub-class, one can get close, but there is a certain amount of drawing in `NOTIFICATION_DRAW` that isn't easily reproduced in subclasses, and exposing this would make this trivial for users creating custom widgets.\n\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"79\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72af9632-5f09-45e5-a67c-30931fe604c7\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nn/a\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119703/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}